{"seq":2,"slug":"foot-placement","title":"足部贴地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/ik/foot-placement","wordCount":1742,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"足部贴地\">足部贴地</h1><p>不开足部 IK 的角色，在斜坡和台阶上会立刻露馅：脚要么悬空浮着、要么扎进地里小腿不见。足部贴地（foot placement / foot IK）是程序化动画里需求最普遍的一项——几乎每个第三人称角色都要它。它的算法核心就是上一篇的<a href=\"ik-solvers\">两骨 IK</a>，难点不在求解而在「探到正确的落点、平滑地调整骨盆、并在脚该抬起时把 IK 关掉」。这一篇把这套完整流程拆开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>足部贴地要解决的问题：美术动画里脚的轨迹是在平地上录的，运行时地面却高低不平，必须把每只脚从「动画给的位置」修正到「真实地面上的位置」，同时连带调整膝盖弯曲与整个骨盆高度，让姿态自然不破。</p>\n<p>整套流程每帧对每条腿走一遍：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[取动画给的脚目标位置] --&gt; B[从脚上方向下发射线&lt;br/&gt;探测真实地面]&#10;  B --&gt; C{射线命中?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[得到地面高度与法线]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[保持动画原位 权重降0]&#10;  D --&gt; F[计算骨盆需下沉量&lt;br/&gt;取两脚最低修正]&#10;  F --&gt; G[下移骨盆 pelvis]&#10;  G --&gt; H[两骨 IK 求腿&lt;br/&gt;末端=地面落点]&#10;  H --&gt; I[按地面法线旋转脚掌&lt;br/&gt;foot roll]&#10;  I --&gt; J[按权重混回动画]\">flowchart TD\n  A[取动画给的脚目标位置] --&gt; B[从脚上方向下发射线&lt;br/&gt;探测真实地面]\n  B --&gt; C{射线命中?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[得到地面高度与法线]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[保持动画原位 权重降0]\n  D --&gt; F[计算骨盆需下沉量&lt;br/&gt;取两脚最低修正]\n  F --&gt; G[下移骨盆 pelvis]\n  G --&gt; H[两骨 IK 求腿&lt;br/&gt;末端=地面落点]\n  H --&gt; I[按地面法线旋转脚掌&lt;br/&gt;foot roll]\n  I --&gt; J[按权重混回动画]</pre><p>四个环节缺一不可：<strong>射线探地</strong>拿到地面信息、<strong>骨盆调整</strong>保证两脚都够得着、<strong>两骨 IK</strong>解出腿姿、<strong>脚掌对齐</strong>让脚贴合坡面。下表是各环节的要点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>做什么</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>射线探地</td>\n<td>脚上方向下射线找地面</td>\n<td>射线起点抬高量、最大探测距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>骨盆调整</td>\n<td>下沉骨盆使两脚都可达</td>\n<td>最大下沉量、平滑速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两骨 IK</td>\n<td>解大腿小腿角度</td>\n<td>极向量（膝朝向）、骨长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脚掌对齐</td>\n<td>按地面法线转脚</td>\n<td>最大 roll 角、对齐插值速度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"射线探地-找到脚该踩在哪\">射线探地：找到脚该踩在哪</h2><p>第一步是知道地面在哪。做法是在每只脚的位置（取动画当前帧的脚骨世界坐标）正上方一点，向下发射一条射线（raycast），让它和地形/碰撞体相交。命中点给两个关键信息：<strong>地面高度</strong>（决定脚该放多高）和<strong>地面法线</strong>（决定脚掌该怎么倾斜贴坡）。</p>\n<p>几个实战细节决定它好不好用。其一，射线<strong>起点要抬到脚的上方</strong>（比如腰高），否则脚已经穿进地里时射线起点也在地下，会漏检；终点要延伸到脚下方一段（容许下台阶）。其二，要<strong>过滤掉角色自身的碰撞体</strong>，别让射线打到自己的腿。其三，对薄平台、网格边缘可加一两条辅助射线或用胶囊投射（spherecast）避免单射线漏检。射线本质是物理查询，它的底层是碰撞检测里的射线-几何求交，详见物理 hub 的<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">碰撞检测窄相位</a>。</p>\n<p>探地有成本——每脚每帧至少一条射线，几百个角色就是上千条射线/帧。所以远处角色要按 LOD 降低探地频率甚至关闭（见<a href=\"../practice/procedural-performance\">程序化动画性能</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"骨盆下沉-让两只脚都够得着\">骨盆下沉：让两只脚都够得着</h2><p>光把每只脚单独放到地面还不够。设想角色一只脚站在台阶上、另一只在台阶下：如果只伸长下方那条腿去够低处地面，腿可能被拉直甚至超出可达范围（够不到）。正确做法是<strong>先把整个骨盆（pelvis / hips）往下移</strong>，移到「两条腿都能舒服地弯曲够到各自落点」的高度。</p>\n<p>算法是：对每只脚算出「动画位置」与「探得的地面位置」之间的垂直差，取所有脚里<strong>需要下沉最多</strong>的那个值作为骨盆下沉量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>（即向最低的脚妥协），然后把骨盆下移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，再对每条腿跑两骨 IK。这样高处的脚自然多弯膝，低处的脚也不至于被拉直。</p>\n<p>骨盆调整必须<strong>平滑</strong>。如果每帧直接跳到目标高度，角色在地形突变处（如踏上台阶瞬间）会上下抽搐。用一个限速或弹簧把骨盆高度的变化平滑过去：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{t} = h_{t-1} + \\mathrm{clamp}(h_{\\text{target}} - h_{t-1},\\ -v\\,\\Delta t,\\ +v\\,\\Delta t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是最大调整速度。还要给一个<strong>最大下沉量</strong>上限，避免在悬崖边缘骨盆塌到地心。这种平滑思路和弹簧阻尼一脉相承，见<a href=\"../dynamics/secondary-motion\">二级动态与弹簧骨</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两骨-ik-与脚掌对齐\">两骨 IK 与脚掌对齐</h2><p>骨盆定好、落点探好，腿姿就是一道标准的两骨 IK：根是髋、末端目标是地面落点，调用上一篇的余弦定理解法即可（<a href=\"ik-solvers\">IK 求解器</a>）。膝盖朝向用极向量约束——通常指向角色正前方，避免膝盖外翻或内扣。</p>\n<p>腿解完，还差脚掌。地面有坡度时，脚不能水平悬着，要按<strong>地面法线</strong>把脚掌转到贴合坡面，这一步叫 foot roll / foot alignment：用射线返回的法线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 算出脚底平面应有的朝向，把脚骨旋转过去。同样要限幅（最大 roll 角，比如 ±40°，太陡的坡不强行贴）并插值平滑。脚尖与脚跟分别探地，还能让脚在台阶边缘自然「踩半只」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"脚抬起时-关掉-ik-足锁与权重\">脚抬起时：关掉 IK（足锁与权重）</h2><p>足部 IK 最容易出 bug 的地方不是站着，而是<strong>走动时脚的抬起与落下</strong>。脚在空中摆动时，绝不能再被 IK 拽到地面——否则角色会拖着脚滑行、迈不开步。解决靠两件事：</p>\n<p>一是<strong>用权重择时开关</strong>。给每条腿的 IK 一个权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>：脚处于支撑相（踩地）时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 全力贴地，处于摆动相（抬起）时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 0 让动画完全接管，落地瞬间再平滑升回 1。判断脚处于哪个相，可读动画曲线（动画师在动画里标好的「脚是否着地」曲线）或用动画通知（notify）打点。这正是程序化层「择时介入」的典型，机制见<a href=\"../practice/blending-authored\">与美术动画融合</a>。</p>\n<p>二是<strong>足锁（foot locking / planting）</strong>，防止支撑脚打滑。理想情况支撑脚在地面上应纹丝不动，但混合、转身可能让它微微滑移；足锁把支撑相的脚位置「钉」在它落地那一刻的世界坐标上，直到抬起才解锁。这对慢走、原地转身的真实感影响很大。配合根运动 warping，还能让脚步精确落在程序生成的踏脚石上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>足部贴地是最普遍的程序化动画需求，算法核心是两骨 IK，难点在探地、骨盆调整、择时开关。</li>\n<li>每帧每腿流程：脚上方向下射线探地（得高度+法线）→ 按最低脚下沉骨盆 → 两骨 IK 解腿 → 按法线对齐脚掌。</li>\n<li>射线探地要抬高起点、过滤自身碰撞、注意薄平台漏检；探地有成本，远处按 LOD 降频。</li>\n<li>骨盆下沉取「需下沉最多」的脚为准，必须限速平滑并设最大下沉量，否则地形突变处会抽搐。</li>\n<li>走动时关键是用权重在支撑相（α=1 贴地）与摆动相（α=0 让动画接管）间平滑切换，并用足锁防支撑脚打滑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"ik-solvers\">IK 求解器</a>（贴地所用的两骨求解）、<a href=\"look-at-aim\">注视与瞄准</a>（IK 的另一应用）、<a href=\"../practice/blending-authored\">与美术动画融合</a>（权重择时开关的机制）、<a href=\"../dynamics/secondary-motion\">二级动态与弹簧骨</a>（骨盆平滑的同源思路）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">物理 — 碰撞检测窄相位</a>（射线探地底层的射线-几何求交）。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>实现要点参考 Unity「IK Foot Placement with Animation Rigging」社区指南与 Two Bone IK 文档（docs.unity3d.com / discussions.unity.com）、Epic Control Rig 足部对齐文档（dev.epicgames.com），2026 年访问。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"足部贴地","id":"足部贴地"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"射线探地：找到脚该踩在哪","id":"射线探地-找到脚该踩在哪"},{"level":2,"text":"骨盆下沉：让两只脚都够得着","id":"骨盆下沉-让两只脚都够得着"},{"level":2,"text":"两骨 IK 与脚掌对齐","id":"两骨-ik-与脚掌对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"脚抬起时：关掉 IK（足锁与权重）","id":"脚抬起时-关掉-ik-足锁与权重"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"IK 求解器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/ik/ik-solvers"},"next":{"title":"注视与瞄准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/ik/look-at-aim"}}